Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.26,0:22:10.89,staff,,185,0,690,,{\blur4\3a55}納莉のSakura
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.26,0:22:10.89,staff,,0,1800,820,,{\an9\fs40\blur4\3a55}後期
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.26,0:22:10.89,staff,,185,0,820,,{\blur4\3a55}芸\Nop200
